      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e can we avoid mmap\u0027ing the restricted regions? i thought that is the whole motivation\n\nThis is plan for restricted_memfd but it\u0027s not yet upstream.\n\n--\n\nI\u0027d let Fuad confirm, but I was suspecting the kvm crate would ignore the restricted memfd info if it\u0027s running under the current ACKs. Crosvm would behave as it does today even though crosvm had allocated restricted memfd. I was planning to do the same for Gunyah.",
